      "message": "Merge main into issue/3643-mesh-bodies (lathe_assembly.rs: keep both sides)\n\nMain took #4278: ResolvedLathe.placed, the facets the app reads its\nlathe body and bands from. This branch grows the resolver's clearance\nby the stack's pad (a meshed body's chord deviation). Kept both:\n`placed` stays the bare facets as on main; a new `ResolvedLathe.pad`\ncarries the pad, and the app's derive grows the bands it builds from\n`placed` by it, so the collision check never reads the smaller bands\nof the bare facets. Pinned by\na_padded_holder_body_keeps_the_grown_bands_in_the_app.\n\nRefs #3643\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
